<translate>
==== MaxDamage ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Used for weapons. Sets the maximum damage factor, which affects the resulting damage.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
MaxDamage = 1.5,
</syntaxhighlight>
